26-05-08\", 1705.25]\n    19\t  ]\n    20\t}\n37970cb\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-daily-revenue-1-808aIl/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-daily-revenue-2-HBZvJU/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-daily-revenue-3-n1Cfgj/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-daily-visits-1-k30Xl4/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-daily-visits-2-UbIDoe/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-daily-visits-3-zmDSyh/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-regional-sales-1-DNPmkQ/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-regional-sales-2-gOKkUW/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-regional-sales-3-JikJY0/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-signups-1-tqvvQy/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-signups-2-ORZvKV/stderr.log\n0\trehearsal/records/release-1e93128/2026-11-19-codex-signups-3-Xmre9Q/stderr.log\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
